--

COMMENT ON TABLE public.d_promise_to_pay_broken_details IS 'Tracks broken promise-to-pay commitments where customers failed to pay as promised, capturing the promised amount and the affected invoice/customer, supporting collections escalation and PTP-reliability analysis. Notes: Records PTP commitments that were broken. id is a clean integer; invoice_id and customer_id are composite. NOTE: ''promice_amount'' is a misspelling of ''promise_amount''. Monetary columns DOUBLE; treat as DECIMAL.';


