--

COMMENT ON TABLE public.sl_warehouses IS 'Master reference for warehouses (stock locations) in the platform. Captures each warehouse''s name, code, address, GSTIN, contact, and operational status, and supplies the warehouse_id used to attribute invoices to a source location. Notes: NOTE: the sample file is named ''s1_warehouses.csv'' (digit ''1'') whereas the schema/table is ''sl_warehouses'' (letter ''l'') — watch the visual confusion. id is a clean integer here (unlike most AR tables). handling_types is JSON (NULL in sample). is_active/is_operational/is_fssai_licensed are 0/1 booleans. gstin and state codes present; name_code is uppercased or NULL.';


